# The ROOT .dockerignore does NOT apply to this image. docker-compose.yml sets
# `context: ./frontend` for the frontend service, so Docker reads THIS file and
# only this file. Without it:
#   * 337 MB of host node_modules + build/ is shipped to the daemon as build
#     context on every build, and
#   * `COPY . .` (after `npm install`) OVERWRITES the node_modules that the
#     install step just produced with the host's copy.
# Both were true on 2026-09-01, the day the host hard-locked mid-build.
node_modules/
build/
.git/
.gitignore
*.md
npm-debug.log*
coverage/
